      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "text": "Solid arrows are the main E2E path.\nDashed complexity is intentionally collapsed into LumosKit.\nBacklight tracks cases and side effects; LumosKit does analysis; consumers read published artifacts or API state.",
      "rawText": "Solid arrows are the main E2E path.\nDashed complexity is intentionally collapsed into LumosKit.\nBacklight tracks cases and side effects; LumosKit does analysis; consumers read published artifacts or API state.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solid arrows are the main E2E path.\nDashed complexity is intentionally collapsed into LumosKit.\nBacklight tracks cases and side effects; LumosKit does analysis; consumers read published artifacts or API state.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 78
    },
